AltoRewardsOracle::updatePriceUpdateCooldownPeriod()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new cooldown period is zero
    │   ├── it should set priceUpdateCooldownPeriod to zero
    │   └── it should emit PriceUpdateCooldownPeriodUpdated event with old and new values
    ├── when new cooldown period is same as current
    │   ├── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleInvalidInput
    └── when new cooldown period is different from current
        ├── it should update priceUpdateCooldownPeriod to new value
        └── it should emit PriceUpdateCooldownPeriodUpdated event with old and new values
